{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MARIOLE is a narrative management game inspired by the traditional culture of the south of France. In the game, you take on the role of a young witch who collects items along the way to barter with the people she meets. You'll need to collect cart parts to unlock the map and find your missing friend, the \u2018Trobairitz\u2019 (a troubadour woman).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is still in development and we plan to release it in 2026.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3830930?t=1771275645","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830930/3b3973d292c54eb6ec7e2e9c0d4f8d732b57a247/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1771275645","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830930/f52417cae32a7d96a25d64f64c1d5a4a71e6472a/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1771275645","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830930/f52417cae32a7d96a25d64f64c1d5a4a71e6472a/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1771275645","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >MARIOLE is a narrative management game inspired by the traditional culture of the south of France. In the game, you take on the role of a young witch who collects items along the way to barter with the people she meets. You'll need to collect cart parts to unlock the map and find your missing friend, the \u2018Trobairitz\u2019 (a troubadour woman).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >It is still in development and we plan to release it in 2026.</p>","developers":["Ram Ram Studio"],"genres":[{"description":"Indie","id":"23"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3830930/4ce02efc20257cbbaca84c3767fec55ffc9a60de/header.jpg?t=1771275645","is_free":false,"linux_require